  (<in> ^request <req>)
  (<req> ^intent procedural ^topic joint-limit-mapping ^seq <seq>)
-->
  (<out> ^reply <reply>)
  (<reply> ^seq <seq> ^kind procedural ^status found ^topic joint-limit-mapping
           ^text |If a joint limit is reached during a mapping mission, block further motion toward the joint limit and report the condition.| ^rule chat*procedural*joint-limit-mapping)
}

